    "Moving gait now preserves native pelvis/first-Spine/Thigh local origins using one shared pelvis solution; detailed actual skin/stance before-after acceptance and source bindings are in skin_gait/summary.json. Existing non-gait facility pose ownership is retained.",
    "Final surface priority110 performs render-only rigid translation of the complete original Neck subtree to the active swim Head after both priority100rigs. Neutral shifts<=1micrometre are skipped, local neck/head lengths/rotations are retained, primary sync removes prior-frame correction, and clothing exit immediately resyncs original rig. Dynamic actual skeleton endpoints are measured after coupling; original import rests, source markers, physics and camera stay untouched."
